            <note corresp="#d72-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d72-f1-content">
                <p>By memorandum of Feb. 17, Lay
                    transmitted copies of this paper to the members of the National Security
                    Council, the Secretary of the Treasury, the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of
                    Staff, and the Acting Director of Central Intelligence. (Disarmament files, lot
                    58 D 133, “NSC Papers, 1953–1955”)</p>
            </note>
